(
    title: "Alien",
    developer: Some("Doug Neubauer"),
    description: Some("A maze game in the Pac-Man mould, themed on the film. You steer a crew member through the corridors of a spaceship, clearing every alien egg from the maze while three aliens chase you. Grabbing a pulsar briefly turns the aliens vulnerable so you can touch them away, and a flamethrower gives you one emergency blast per life; clearing a maze leads to a short bonus dash."),
